From: lishuangfan13-afk <lishuangfan13@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] bes: start the headless assistant for the Zhaoxi profile

Select the existing Agent without its console reader when the screen-free
product frontend is configured. Other board profiles keep their startup.
Based on vendor_bes 36465377d944a575ce8a0c7ba45259f5c6c61ea8.
Do not apply the archived display startup patch 0004.

diff --git a/boards/best1700_ep/aos_evb/src/etc/init.d/rcS.ap b/boards/best1700_ep/aos_evb/src/etc/init.d/rcS.ap
--- a/boards/best1700_ep/aos_evb/src/etc/init.d/rcS.ap
+++ b/boards/best1700_ep/aos_evb/src/etc/init.d/rcS.ap
@@ -38,10 +38,16 @@
 bluetoothd &
 #endif
 
+#ifdef CONFIG_EXAMPLES_ZHAOXI
+#ifdef CONFIG_EXAMPLES_AI_AGENT_VELA
+ai_agent --headless &
+#endif
+#else
 #ifdef CONFIG_BESWATCH
 beswatch &
 #else
 lvgldemo widgets &
+#endif
 #endif
 
 #ifdef CONFIG_KVDB_PERSIST_PATH
